error: `unwrap_or_default` replaces `TryFromIntError` with a fallback value
   --> tools/dylint/examples/duplicate_type.rs:418:52
    |
418 |     shim.port.strict_add(u16::try_from(shim.limit).unwrap_or_default())
    |                                                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = help: match the `Result`, handle each error the caller acts on, and return the rest with `?`
    = note: `#[deny(discarded_error)]` on by default

error: error `u16` is a primitive that names no failure
   --> tools/dylint/examples/duplicate_type.rs:469:25
    |
469 | const fn outcome(value: Result<u8, u16>) -> Outcome<u8, u16> {
    |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = help: return the concrete source error, or add a domain error for context or distinct failures
    = note: `#[deny(untyped_error)]` on by default

